            <title>TML Tunnel Manager v6.9.3</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 11 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>25</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>6.9.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>13.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <h3>What's new in v6.9.3</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>New: Tunnel dependency configuration — connect dependent tunnels automatically</li>
                    <li>Auto-reconnect on network drop respects tunnel order and dependencies</li>
                    <li>Circular dependency protection in settings</li>
                    <li>Dependency indicator shown in menu bar (via ssh-ext)</li>
                    <li>Password change flow works correctly with dependencies</li>
                    <li>Bug fixes</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
